DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43462::$$$message_0366_0000_0000$$$::"Care for seconds, Saber?[lr]::
43463::$$$message_0366_0000_0001$$$::We still have half of the rice left, so I was thinking about frying up the leftovers."::
43464::$$$message_0366_0000_0002$$$::"If there are leftovers, then I will have some."::
43465::$$$message_0366_0001_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=セイバー face=喜 layer=1 time=200]"I must say, though...today's hamburger steak was exquisitely braised."::
43466::$$$message_0366_0001_0001$$$::"I might tire of it if you were to cook it into fried rice. Om nom nom."::
43467::$$$message_0366_0001_0002$$$::"But I'm going to eat it too. We'll go through it faster than you think."::
43468::$$$message_0366_0001_0003$$$::"Come on, make some room on the table. I made lettuce fried rice that should refresh your palate."::
43469::$$$message_0366_0001_0004$$$::"Ooh! This is...such a bright dish.[lr]::
43470::$$$message_0366_0001_0005$$$::The glistening white fried rice harmonizes nicely with the verdant green vegetables."::
43471::$$$message_0366_0001_0006$$$::"I think I could, om nom, have another two bowls, nom nom, not just one."::
43472::$$$message_0366_0001_0007$$$::"Yeah? Then eat up. I'll clean up when you're done, and then we can go to the dojo."::
43473::$$$message_0366_0001_0008$$$::"You know, I got a phone call from the church saying that the Holy Grail War started."::
43474::$$$message_0366_0001_0009$$$::"The Holy Grail War...? Come to think of it, I found this[l][fg textoff=0 left=327 index=1000 top=227 time=400 storage=星a][say storage=HSTR2_SAV_0080 _name=セイバー] in the mail this morning."::
43475::$$$message_0366_0001_0010$$$::"What's that? A patchy crystal ball...?"::
43476::$$$message_0366_0001_0011$$$::"It looks like a zebra pattern, but it may be some kind of holy relic. I believe this may be what the Masters are competing for."::
43477::$$$message_0366_0001_0012$$$::"...This is getting hairy again. Maybe I'll take it back to Kotomine. I'll tell him not to sign us up for a war we didn't even ask for."::
43478::$$$message_0366_0001_0013$$$::"Mmph!? Th-that's not true, Shirou.[lr]::
43479::$$$message_0366_0001_0014$$$::[hffacechg chara=セイバー face=哀2 layer=1 time=200][hfsigh layer=1]I've thought this for a while, but you really have no selfish desires."::
43480::$$$message_0366_0001_0015$$$::"Perhaps that is one of your virtues, but surely you won't be punished for wishing for better things."::
43481::$$$message_0366_0001_0016$$$::"Huh? Wh-what do you mean, Saber?[lr]::
43482::$$$message_0366_0001_0017$$$::I'm not giving you any more seconds if you keep glaring like that."::
43483::$$$message_0366_0001_0018$$$::"That's not what I'm talking about!"::
43484::$$$message_0366_0001_0019$$$::"Shirou, I'm saying that you should have a tangible wish or a concrete goal like any other human being!"::
43485::$$$message_0366_0001_0020$$$::"It's only right that my Master has ambitions of some kind!"::
43486::$$$message_0366_0001_0021$$$::"Mrgh. It's not very persuasive when you say that while clutching a pair of chopsticks, but I'll hear you out.[lr]::
43487::$$$message_0366_0001_0022$$$::[hffacechg chara=士郎 face=呆 layer=0 time=200]What kind of goals did you have in mind?"::
43488::$$$message_0366_0001_0023$$$::"I... Well, it goes without saying.[lr]::
43489::$$$message_0366_0001_0024$$$::Right now, your only hobby and purpose in life is cooking."::
43490::$$$message_0366_0001_0025$$$::"(...Oh, is that how it seems to you, Saber?)"::
43491::$$$message_0366_0001_0026$$$::"So there's only one thing you need wish for!"::
43492::$$$message_0366_0001_0027$$$::"You should obtain the ideal space in which to exercise your culinary endeavors, so that you can polish your skills even further!"::
43493::$$$message_0366_0001_0028$$$::"In other words, you should create a specialized establishment where you can cook whenever you want."::
43494::$$$message_0366_0001_0029$$$::"I will do whatever it takes to help you accomplish that goal, and gladly assume the role of product manager upon its completion!"::
43495::$$$message_0366_0001_0030$$$::"So...you're telling me to use the power of the Holy Grail to open my own restaurant?"::
43496::$$$message_0366_0001_0031$$$::"(Absolutely straight-faced) Yes. I believe it is a worthwhile goal that merges profit and (my) interest.[lr]::
43497::$$$message_0366_0001_0032$$$::[hffacechg chara=セイバー face=驚 layer=1 time=200]Or does that not please you, Shirou?"::
43498::$$$message_0366_0001_0033$$$::"Hmm. If I had a restaurant, I could make a living doing what I already enjoy as a hobby."::
43499::$$$message_0366_0002_0000$$$::"I'm not against cooking, but I also don't necessarily want to do it 24/7."::
43500::$$$message_0366_0002_0001$$$::"Besides, it means I wouldn't be able to cook the things you like to eat."::
43501::$$$message_0366_0003_0000$$$::"It's not that I love cooking itself. I just like making you happy, Saber."::
43502::$$$message_0366_0003_0001$$$::"Mmm. Th-that's equally true of me, [l][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=哀2 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR2_SAV_0280 _name=セイバー]but as it stands, I'm the only one benefiting from this arrangement."::
43503::$$$message_0366_0003_0002$$$::"You deserve something in return. Haven't you ever thought that you could open your own workshop, with your considerable skills?"::
43504::$$$message_0366_0003_0003$$$::"I'm already doing that. I only have one regular customer, but she's plenty."::
43505::$$$message_0366_0003_0004$$$::"And she's not just any guest, but a [font italic=true]king[font italic=false]. I couldn't ask someone better to grace the dining table."::
43506::$$$message_0366_0003_0005$$$::"Shirou..."::
43507::$$$message_0366_0003_0006$$$::"...This was foolish of me. We don't need a wish that only a miracle can grant."::
43508::$$$message_0366_0004_0000$$$::[se storage=se396.wav][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=407 magnify=1.1 time=80 my=351 path=(378,329,100,1.2)(363,367,255,1.3)(420,364,255,1.4)(398,302,255,1.5)(504,362,255,1.6)(300,387,255,1.7)(440,379,255,1.8)(374,413,255,1.9)(406,440,255,2) storage=藤道場03b(遠) accel=0][nolr]"Being the only one to taste your food is the greatest luxury I could[line len=2]"[p]::
43509::$$$message_0366_0004_0001$$$::"GWAAAAHHH![lr]::
43510::$$$message_0366_0004_0002$$$::That just makes it a king's restaurant!"[nolr]::
43511::$$$message_0366_0005_0000$$$::"It's giving me diabetes, diiiie![lr]::
43512::$$$message_0366_0005_0001$$$::[nolr]This is too embarrassing to watch anymore!"[wm canskip=0][fg opacity=0 left=71 index=5000 top=558 time=100 storage=hf_ブルマイリヤ-怒][fg opacity=0 left=0 index=500 top=0 time=100 storage=m02タイガーぱんちb][p]::
43513::$$$message_0366_0005_0002$$$::"Same here! Whaddya mean you don't have a wish!? Shirou, you hack!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
43514::$$$message_0366_0006_0000$$$::"Right now, you're no different than a zookeeper feeding a caged lion!"::
43515::$$$message_0366_0007_0000$$$::"Hurry up and realize that your Servant is taking advantage of you!"[wm canskip=0]::
43516::$$$message_0366_0008_0000$$$::"...? What's going on, Taiga? Illyasviel? And aren't you cold in that strange attire?"::
43517::$$$message_0366_0008_0001$$$::"No! I am not the slightly feisty, steamy teacher [skip_next_tag][br]::
43518::$$$message_0366_0008_0002$$$::you know as Fuji-nee!"::
43519::$$$message_0366_0009_0000$$$::"You and I are irreconcilable enemies in the Holy Grail War!"::
43520::$$$message_0366_0009_0001$$$::"S-steamy? It has a somewhat appetizing ring to it. [wait canskip=0 time=300][l][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=怒 layer=0 time=200][say storage=HSTR2_SAV_0360 _name=セイバー]What is this 'steamy' she speaks of, Shirou!?"::
43521::$$$message_0366_0009_0002$$$::"Something she doesn't have, I guess."::
43522::$$$message_0366_0009_0003$$$::"Another no! Fuji-nee no longer exists! We are Tiger & Gym Shorts! [wm][l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR2_TIG_0080 _name=藤ねえ]Starved beasts out to devour the world's obliviously mushy couples!"::
43523::$$$message_0366_0009_0004$$$::"Oh, and by the way, 'steamy' is like a dark furikake seasoning you sprinkle over white rice to signal that it's lunchtime."::
43524::$$$message_0366_0009_0005$$$::"...No matter how sketchy you're acting today, it's obviously you, Fuji-nee."::
43525::$$$message_0366_0009_0006$$$::"Yes. They are Taiga and Illyasviel wearing strange clothes."::
43526::$$$message_0366_0010_0000$$$::"Speaking of which, I haven't seen you lately. Have you been traveling?"::
43527::$$$message_0366_0010_0001$$$::"Not in the slightest! Darn it, seeing you act like business as usual is actually a weight off my back! [seloop time=2000 storage=se347.wav]Now it's time to destroy the Earth!"::
43528::$$$message_0366_0010_0002$$$::"No way... Could this be...!?"::
43529::$$$message_0366_0010_0003$$$::"!?!? Shirou, something's wrong!"::
43530::$$$message_0366_0011_0000$$$::"The fried rice, that delicious lettuce fried rice you made, is transforming into a bizarre card!"::
43531::$$$message_0366_0011_0001$$$::"Ugh. This is bad, Saber.[lr]::
43532::$$$message_0366_0011_0002$$$::[hffacechg chara=士郎 face=悩 layer=0 time=200]This Fuji-nee and Illya might not be the Fuji-nee and Illya we know!"::
43533::$$$message_0366_0011_0003$$$::"That's what I've been saying! How are you so slow on the uptake?"[nolr][p]::

